        "name": "Amy Lyell",
        "speciality": "Concept Artist/Character Designer",
        "artistStatement": "I am a passionate and diligent 2D Generalist, most practiced in character design and concept art for animation and games. I love creating and developing thought out and immersive characters, creatures and worlds of all kinds, with a great love for fantasy and fashion. My skills predominantly consist of illustration in software’s such as ClipStudioPaint and Photoshop as well as traditional paper illustration, which I use to bring characters and their stories to life. I have experience with working in a creative team and I am dedicated to developing my technical and creative skills by remaining open to all sorts of mediums and inspirations so I can continue to improve and broaden my creative palette.",
